      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="DSCF0009a.jpg">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG> You've come this far. Why not join up. See below
      for all our contact information.</BIG></FONT>
      <P ALIGN=Left>
      &nbsp;
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"> <BIG>E-Mail Address: </BIG></FONT>You can contact
      Kevin Thomson for all your enquiries at
      ....<A href="mailto: soga@bell.net "><BIG><FONT COLOR="#0000ff">soga@bell.net</FONT></BIG>
      </A>&nbsp; &nbsp;
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG>Operations Address:</BIG></FONT> &nbsp;( New location
      as of October 2018 )
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG> New Location:</BIG></FONT> &nbsp; - 195329 Amaranth
      East Luther Townline, Amaranth, Ontario.
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;
      &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - GPS Coordinates: N 44.017194, W -80.327903
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG>General Location:</BIG></FONT> About 12 km west
      south-west of Shelburne, Ontario
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Left>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG>Directions: </BIG></FONT>Just put it into your
      GPS. :-)
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG><BIG>************</BIG></BIG></FONT>
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      If you are planning to come visit us at our field, be sure to check if we
      are flying.
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Flying days are usually listed in the EVENTS section on our public
      <A HREF="https://www.facebook.com/groups/soga.hg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Face
      Book</A> page.&nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d298.40888402058613!2d-80.3289922039968!3d44.017087300000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x882a4d78f9445d77%3A0x6afbc14e7a4728e5!2sSOGA!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sca!4v1622341422396!5m2!1sen!2sca"
      width="600" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      If you are brand new to the concept of hang gliding and want to get <BR>
      involved, or, if you just want more information, here is a short list of 
      hang gliding <BR>
  
    training schools
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      <A HREF="https://instinct.pro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instinct
      Windsports</A> is near Kitchener Ontario
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      <A HREF="https://www.hpac.ca/schools-and-certified-instructors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> HPAC listed schools
      </A> List of schools aproved by HPAC 
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG><BIG>************</BIG></BIG></FONT>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG><BIG></BIG></BIG></FONT>
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      If you are a hang glider pilot and want to get your aerotow rating
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      then drop us a line at <BIG><FONT COLOR="#0000ff">soga@bell.net </FONT></BIG>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <FONT COLOR="#0000ff"><BIG><BIG>************</BIG></BIG></FONT>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      So take some time to peruse this website, <BR>
      <BR>
      and you can always find us on our public Face Book page.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
